    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, quick question. i have a really bad sinus infection like my head is literally throbbing. i'm on lisinopril for my blood pressure (doc says i have stage 2 hypertension) but is it okay if i take some sudafed to clear this up? i just need some relief so i can sleep.",
