      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that, but i really hate the feeling of being clogged up. i've taken sudafed before and it never really made my blood pressure spike much, just a little bit of jitters. is it really that dangerous if i just do one dose of the regular strength stuff? i'm just looking for a way to get through tonight.",
