    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "claritin doesnt really help with the stuffiness though, it just makes me sleepy. i'm not looking to start a whole new med regimen, i just want to know if i can just take one single 60mg tablet of the pseudoephedrine tonight so i can breathe and stop this headache. it would be such a relief. is it really a hard no for just one pill?",
